# Deny by default; scripts/build-image sends only committed allowlisted inputs.
**
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!app/
!app/**
!migrations/
!migrations/*.sql
!deploy/
!deploy/container_entrypoint.py
**/.env*
**/.git
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.db
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/data
**/private
